Building scalable speech and conversational architectures.

### Profile
Senior Speech Application Engineer with 3 years of experience in developing advanced chatbots and voicebots using transformer models and LLMs[cite: 1]. I specialize in designing and deploying microservices architectures and conversational systems, enhancing capabilities in handling bulk interactions[cite: 1].

